            </div>

            <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-subtle via-surface to-gold/10 border border-gold/50 space-y-2 border-t-2 border-t-gold ring-1 ring-gold/20 shadow-xs">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-accent">
                <span class="font-bold uppercase text-accent-secondary">Third Turning</span>
                <span>Vaiśālī & Elsewhere</span>
